A(71,"b",["Kelas I (null) juga sering.","Benar: kelas II (gagal transport reseptor) paling sering.","Kelas III: gagal mengikat LDL.","Kelas IV: gagal internalisasi.","Keliru."],"Hiperkolesterolemia familial autosomal dominan, xantoma tendon.")
